    "body": "Revisions landed and gated on issue/356-commands-mcp-process (f29c51de):\n- AGENTS.md: Converted the command-MCP rule into a clean prose paragraph matching the section style.\n- .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md: Listed all 34 tools currently in crates/app/src/mcp/, noted that the initial gaps from #356 (#180, #181, #182, #312, #355) have all shipped, and documented the current remaining gaps (part model translation/rotation MoveModel, high-level setup alignment, mesh repair, document units lens, persistent program numbers/comments, pocket/slot feature recognition, STEP tool body attachments, and live GUI socket session).\n- Clarified the panic note: emphasized that systems/commands forbid panics per the Prime Directive and that catch_unwind in mcp/mod.rs serves strictly as a cold, last-resort crash barrier.\n- Quick gate passed cleanly. Flagged ready for review.",
